# VitePress (`docs/`)

## Config

- `docs/.vitepress/config.js` — `title`, `description`, `themeConfig.nav`, `themeConfig.footer`, `head` meta.
- With `cleanUrls: true`, use links **without** `.html` (e.g. `/about`, `/blog/`).

## New pages & sections

- Follow existing app folder patterns (e.g. `docs/slotspace/`, `docs/*-privacy-policy/`).
- Add **`themeConfig.nav`** entries when pages should appear in the global nav.

## Markdown

- Keep heading hierarchy consistent (`#` → `##` → `###`).
- Use internal links that match VitePress rules (relative or root paths).

## reply-bridge sync

- When importing policy or marketing copy, open the matching file in **reply-bridge**—do not invent features.
